   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The body and how we are",
     "texto": [
      "Today we see more parts of the body and new ways of talking about it.\n\n- **From the neck down:** the **hombro** (shoulder), the **pecho** (chest), the **cintura** (waist). On the arm, the **codo** (elbow) and the **muñeca** (wrist). Inside, the **pulmones** (lungs).\n- **What the body does:** **respirar** (to breathe), **saltar** (to jump), **soltar** (to let go of) something you were holding, **oler** (to smell) a flower.\n- **Ages:** a **recién nacido** (newborn), a child, an adult, an **anciano** (elderly man).\n- **How we are:** with **estar** and an adjective, for example **está embarazada** or **está distraído**.\n- **Attitude:** **tener** a positive attitude. And when something is a shame: **¡Qué lástima!**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Verbs with o → ue",
     "texto": [
      "Some verbs change the **o** of the stem into **ue** when that syllable carries the stress:\n\n- **soltar** → suelto, sueltas, suelta, soltamos, soltáis, sueltan\n- **oler** → **huelo**, hueles, huele, olemos, oléis, huelen\n- **poder**, **volver**, **dormir** and **doler** change in the same way.\n\nIn **nosotros** and **vosotros** the stress falls on the ending, and the **o** does not change: **soltamos**, **olemos**.\n\nAt the start of a word, the sound «ue» is written **hue-**: that is why it is **huele**. To say what something smells of, use **oler a**: huele a café."
     ],
